{
  "title": "koksu",
  "description": "Koksu bot, E-cadence variant. Outer loop every 700ms scans the bobber area for green. No green → press E (idle recast). Green found → pixel-watch a 20x20 window centered on green's match for red (background thread, no polling sleeps). 5s timeout on the red watch so a false-positive green doesn't trap the macro; on timeout the outer loop iterates again and re-scans. When red touches, press E.",
